{"seq":3,"slug":"quotient-filters","title":"商过滤器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/membership/quotient-filters","wordCount":1733,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"商过滤器\">商过滤器</h1><p><a href=\"bloom-filters\">布隆过滤器</a>在算法课上是明星，但在对 CPU 缓存极度敏感的系统里，它有个隐疾：一次查询要访问 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个散落在位数组各处的位置，每个都可能是一次缓存未命中。商过滤器（Quotient Filter）从内存布局这个完全不同的角度重新设计成员结构——它把所有信息塞进一段连续数组，让一次查询基本只碰一个缓存行，还顺带获得了无损扩容与高效合并的能力。它代表了「把概率结构当成系统组件来设计」的思路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-商与余数\">核心概念：商与余数</h2><p>商过滤器的出发点是一个朴素的拆分。对元素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 算一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 比特的哈希指纹 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>，把它劈成两段：高位的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 比特叫<strong>商（quotient）</strong>，低位的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 比特叫<strong>余数（remainder）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mrow><mi>q</mi><mtext> 比特, 商</mtext></mrow></munder><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mrow><mi>r</mi><mtext> 比特, 余数</mtext></mrow></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f = \\underbrace{f_q}_{q \\text{ 比特, 商}} \\cdot 2^r + \\underbrace{f_r}_{r \\text{ 比特, 余数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.443em;vertical-align:-1.7485em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.3876em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">比特</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">, </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">商</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.0659em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9341em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7485em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7977em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3513em;vertical-align:-1.6569em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4792em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">比特</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">, </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">余数</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.1576em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8424em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6569em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>数组有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>q</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个槽位。商 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 直接当数组下标，决定元素的「本应所在槽位（canonical slot）」；余数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是真正存进去的内容。这就是它的关键洞见：<strong>商隐含在位置里，不必存储</strong>——知道一个余数存在哪个槽附近，就能反推出它的商，从而还原完整指纹。这和<a href=\"../foundations/hashing-foundations\">哈希基础</a>里讲的「截取哈希不同位段」是同一套手法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  X[元素 x] --&gt; HASH[p 比特哈希指纹 f]&#10;  HASH --&gt; SPLIT{劈成两段}&#10;  SPLIT --&gt;|高 q 位| QUO[商 fq = 数组下标]&#10;  SPLIT --&gt;|低 r 位| REM[余数 fr = 存入内容]&#10;  QUO --&gt; SLOT[定位本应所在槽]&#10;  REM --&gt; STORE[把余数存到该槽附近的连续区]&#10;  STORE --&gt; CL[全部数据连续 → 缓存友好]\">flowchart TD\n  X[元素 x] --&gt; HASH[p 比特哈希指纹 f]\n  HASH --&gt; SPLIT{劈成两段}\n  SPLIT --&gt;|高 q 位| QUO[商 fq = 数组下标]\n  SPLIT --&gt;|低 r 位| REM[余数 fr = 存入内容]\n  QUO --&gt; SLOT[定位本应所在槽]\n  REM --&gt; STORE[把余数存到该槽附近的连续区]\n  STORE --&gt; CL[全部数据连续 → 缓存友好]</pre><h2 id=\"软碰撞与三个元数据位\">软碰撞与三个元数据位</h2><p>多个元素的商相同（即映射到同一槽位）是必然会发生的「软碰撞」。商过滤器用线性探测的思路解决：碰撞的余数往后顺延存放，形成一段连续的「run」。但线性探测有个老问题——一旦顺延，怎么知道某个余数原本属于哪个商？商过滤器的答案是给每个槽位附加三个元数据位：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>is_occupied</strong>：这个槽位对应的商，是否有元素存在（哪怕实际余数被挤到了别处）。</li>\n<li><strong>is_continuation</strong>：当前槽里的余数，是否和前一个槽属于同一个 run（同一个商）。</li>\n<li><strong>is_shifted</strong>：当前余数是否被从它的本应所在槽挤走了。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>靠这三个位，就能在连续数组里精确地把每个 run 归属回正确的商，从而无歧义地查询。查询元素时，算出商定位起点、顺着 run 扫描比对余数即可。误判只来自余数碰撞，误判率约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{-r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——余数每多一比特，误判率减半，这正是<a href=\"../foundations/space-accuracy-tradeoff\">空间与精度权衡</a>里那条曲线在商过滤器上的体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"商过滤器的三大优势\">商过滤器的三大优势</h2><p>商过滤器付出了三个元数据位的代价，换来三个布隆和布谷鸟都不太具备的能力。</p>\n<p>第一是<strong>缓存友好</strong>。所有数据连续排布，一次查询的探测落在相邻槽位，通常只触碰一到两个缓存行，而布隆的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个哈希位置散落各处可能引发 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次缓存未命中。在内存带宽是瓶颈的高吞吐场景，这个差别很实在。</p>\n<p>第二是<strong>无损扩容（resize）</strong>。这是商过滤器最独特的能力。当过滤器快满时，可以把商多取一位、余数少取一位（或重哈希到更大数组），由于完整指纹信息都保存着（商隐含在位置、余数显式存储），扩容<strong>不丢失任何元素、不引入额外误判</strong>。布隆过滤器做不到这点——它只存了置位信息，无法还原元素来重新分布。</p>\n<p>第三是<strong>高效合并</strong>。两个商过滤器合并，本质是归并两段有序的余数序列，比逐元素重插快得多。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>布隆</th>\n<th>布谷鸟</th>\n<th>商过滤器</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缓存友好</td>\n<td>差（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 处分散）</td>\n<td>好（2 桶）</td>\n<td>好（连续）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无损扩容</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持（需重建）</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并</td>\n<td>同参数按位或</td>\n<td>不易</td>\n<td>归并，高效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间效率</td>\n<td>最优区接近下界</td>\n<td>低误判更省</td>\n<td>略逊于布隆</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"变体与适用场景\">变体与适用场景</h2><p>商过滤器的连续布局还催生了几个面向存储系统的变体。</p>\n<p><strong>计数商过滤器（CQF, Counting Quotient Filter）</strong>：在商过滤器基础上高效编码重复元素的计数，于是同时支持成员查询和频率估计——某种意义上把本章的「成员」和<a href=\"../cardinality-frequency/\">下一章</a>的「频率」缝在了一个结构里，在基因组学等需要数 k-mer 频次的领域很受欢迎。</p>\n<p><strong>RSQF（Rank-and-Select Quotient Filter）</strong>：用 rank/select 位运算技巧压缩元数据位，进一步省空间、提速，是现代高性能实现的基础。</p>\n<p>适用场景上，商过滤器的甜点是<strong>写多、需要扩容、对缓存敏感</strong>的存储引擎层。需要随数据增长平滑扩容而不重建时，它的无损 resize 是杀手锏。反过来，如果只是个一次性构建、之后只读、参数固定的场景（比如 SSTable 的过滤器），布隆的简单和极致空间效率往往更划算——这类取舍会在<a href=\"../practice/systems-applications\">系统应用</a>和<a href=\"../practice/pitfalls-tuning\">陷阱与调参</a>里结合真实系统再谈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"查询一次走过的路\">查询一次走过的路</h2><p>把抽象的元数据位落成一次具体查询，会更容易记住它的工作方式。查询元素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>：先算指纹、劈出商 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和余数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；跳到下标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的槽，看它的 <code>is_occupied</code> 位——若为 0，说明这个商从没有元素，直接返回「一定不在」（这又是单边误差，和<a href=\"bloom-filters\">布隆过滤器</a>同源）。若为 1，则需要找到属于这个商的那段 run：由于前面的元素可能把它挤后了，要借助 <code>is_shifted</code> 和 <code>is_continuation</code> 位向前回溯定位 run 的起点，再顺着 run 逐个比对余数。命中某个等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的余数就返回「可能在」，扫完整段都没有就返回「一定不在」。</p>\n<p>整段扫描通常落在相邻的几个槽里，因而只碰一两个缓存行——这正是它缓存友好的来源。理解这条路径，也就理解了为什么三个元数据位缺一不可：少了任何一个，都无法在连续数组里无歧义地还原「哪段 run 属于哪个商」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>商过滤器把哈希指纹劈成商与余数：商当数组下标（隐含不存储），余数显式存入连续数组，是面向缓存布局的成员结构。</li>\n<li>软碰撞（商相同）用线性探测顺延加三个元数据位（is_occupied / is_continuation / is_shifted）解决，余数碰撞带来约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{-r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的误判率。</li>\n<li>三大优势：缓存友好（数据连续）、无损扩容（指纹信息完整可重分布）、高效合并（归并有序余数）。</li>\n<li>变体 CQF 兼做频率计数、RSQF 用 rank/select 压缩提速。</li>\n<li>甜点场景是写多、要扩容、缓存敏感的存储层；只读固定场景仍以布隆更划算。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"商过滤器","id":"商过滤器"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：商与余数","id":"核心概念-商与余数"},{"level":2,"text":"软碰撞与三个元数据位","id":"软碰撞与三个元数据位"},{"level":2,"text":"商过滤器的三大优势","id":"商过滤器的三大优势"},{"level":2,"text":"变体与适用场景","id":"变体与适用场景"},{"level":2,"text":"查询一次走过的路","id":"查询一次走过的路"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"计数与布谷鸟过滤器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/membership/counting-cuckoo"},"next":{"title":"HyperLogLog 基数估计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/cardinality-frequency/hyperloglog"}}